-- הסכם קיבוצי — החלת עלות הסכם המסגרת ופרקי זמן השהייה הנדרשים לצורך
-- קידום בדרגות (31.8.2016): a temporary agreement, in force until the
-- collective agreement that is to replace it is signed. It puts off the
-- first allocation of the agreement of 22.2.2016 ("הסכם 2016") from
-- 1.9.2016 to 1.10.2016, and from 1.9.2016 it lengthens again the waiting
-- periods for promotion in grades that the follow-up committee's decision of
-- 19.2.2015 set: 26 months to grades 2 and 3, 37 to grades 4–6 and 38 to
-- grades 7–9.
--
-- An amendment encodes what it changes, dated. The new periods are written
-- here from 1.9.2016 beside the decision of 19.2.2015, imported, which in
-- turn sets them beside the base agreement's §38. The agreement of
-- 22.2.2016 is in the corpus but not yet encoded: its §6 salary base and
-- whom it covers are named inputs here. The September 2013 agreement
-- (17.9.2013), cited only in the recitals, is not imported.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `base-agreement-38`
IMPORT `2015-02-19_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakav_darga-stay-periods-1800-quota`

-- The day the new periods start (§4(ב)).
`1 September 2016` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2016

§ `הסכם החלת עלות הסכם המסגרת ופרקי זמן השהייה — 31.8.2016`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.

-- The day of signing, written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p2
`the day the 31.8.2016 agreement was signed` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2016

-- akn:preamble/p3 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 15.01.2017 as no. 269/2016; no rule of the agreement.

-- The parties: the State, by the Treasury's (acting) wages commissioner and
-- the Ministry of Education's director-general, and the teachers' union,
-- by its secretary-general.
@ref akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:conclusions/t1
`the 31.8.2016 agreement's parties` MEANS LIST `the State`, `the teachers' union`

-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.

-- The recitals: the 2013 agreement (17.9.2013) bound the parties to
-- negotiate applying a later framework agreement's cost to its period
-- (27.8.2013–30.6.2015); the general framework agreement of 18.4.2016
-- (1.1.2013–31.12.2017) was signed; the agreement of 22.2.2016 ("הסכם 2016")
-- applied its cost; under §15 of the 2013 agreement and the amended
-- framework of 8.8.2016 the parties negotiated a wage agreement to
-- 30.6.2018 and agreed to allocate the 2016 agreement's cost otherwise; no
-- agreed text is ready, and some of the 2016 agreement starts on 1.9.2016.
@ref akn:preamble/p10
`the 2013 agreement's period` MEANS LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 27 8 2013, DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2015

@ref akn:preamble/p11
`the general framework agreement's period` MEANS LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013, DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2017

@ref akn:preamble/p12
`the 2016 agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 22 2 2016

@ref akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15
`the wage agreement negotiated runs to` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2018

@ref akn:preamble/p16
`parts of the 2016 agreement start on` MEANS `1 September 2016`

-- The fifth and sixth recitals: what the parties agreed applies for now,
-- until a collective agreement is signed whose provisions replace this
-- one's.
@ref akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18
GIVEN `the replacing collective agreement has been signed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 31.8.2016 agreement is in force` `the replacing collective agreement has been signed` IF
    NOT `the replacing collective agreement has been signed`

#ASSERT `the 31.8.2016 agreement is in force` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the 31.8.2016 agreement is in force` TRUE

-- akn:preamble/p19 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 הוראות כלליות`

-- (א): the preamble is an inseparable part of the agreement.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1__para_a
`the preamble of the 31.8.2016 agreement binds as the agreement` MEANS TRUE

-- (ב)–(ג): the masculine reads as the feminine and the singular as the
-- plural (the corpus marks (ג)'s "singular … singular" as printed), and
-- the reverse, unless expressly said otherwise.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_c
GIVEN `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the 31.8.2016 agreement reads in the other gender and number` `expressly limited` IF
    NOT `expressly limited`

-- (ד): the headings are for convenience and do not interpret it.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d
GIVEN `the reading without the headings` IS A STRING, `the reading the headings suggest` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the reading the 31.8.2016 agreement takes` `the reading without the headings` `the reading the headings suggest` IS
    `the reading without the headings`

§§ `2 תחולה`

-- Every employee on the teaching employees' scale to whom the 2016
-- agreement applies ("עובדי הוראה"). Whom the 2016 agreement covers is its
-- own rule, not yet encoded: an input.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` IS A BOOLEAN, `the 2016 agreement applies to him` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 31.8.2016 agreement applies to` `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` `the 2016 agreement applies to him` IF
    `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` AND `the 2016 agreement applies to him`

§§ `3 תיקון הסכם 2016`

-- The allocation the 2016 agreement's §5(א)(1) made from 1.9.2016 is put
-- off to 1.10.2016: in its place, from 1.10.2016, 1% of the salary base of
-- §6 ("§6 below" in the clause it replaces: the 2016 agreement's own §6,
-- the monthly average of January–December 2015), allocated as a uniform
-- shekel sum to the employees this agreement covers.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
`the first allocation of the 2016 agreement, as it was` MEANS `1 September 2016`

@ref akn:art_3/p1
`the first allocation of the 2016 agreement starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2016

@ref akn:art_3/p1
`the first allocation's rate` MEANS 1%

-- The cost of the first allocation on a day: 1% of the 2016 agreement's §6
-- salary base (an input), from 1.10.2016.
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the salary base of the 2016 agreement's §6` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the first allocation's cost on` d `the salary base of the 2016 agreement's §6` IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the first allocation of the 2016 agreement starts on`
    THEN `the first allocation's rate` TIMES `the salary base of the 2016 agreement's §6`
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the first allocation's cost on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2016) 1000000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the first allocation's cost on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2016) 1000000 EQUALS 10000

-- "Uniform shekel": the same sum to every teacher with the same position
-- share, whatever his grade or pay (the 2016 agreement's own definition);
-- the sum for a full position is what the cost buys, an input.
GIVEN `the sum for a full position` IS A NUMBER, position IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the uniform shekel supplement` `the sum for a full position` position IS
    `the sum for a full position` `pro rata to a position of` position

#ASSERT `the uniform shekel supplement` 200 (50%) EQUALS 100

§§ `4 קידום בדרגות — תיקון הסכם אופק חדש כנוסחו לפי החלטת ועדת המעקב מיום 19.2.2015`

-- (א): the section reaches the teachers to whom §38 of the base agreement,
-- as amended from time to time, applies.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_a
GIVEN `§38 applies to him` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§4 of the 31.8.2016 agreement applies to` `§38 applies to him` IF
    `§38 applies to him`

-- (ב)(1): from 1.9.2016 §38(ב), as the decision of 19.2.2015 worded it,
-- reads: 26 months in grade 1 for grade 2 and in grade 2 for grade 3, 37
-- months for grades 4, 5 and 6. (ב)(2): §38(ו) reads 38 months for grades
-- 7, 8 and 9.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN `to grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months in the grade below for promotion to, as the 31.8.2016 agreement sets them` `to grade` IS
    BRANCH IF `to grade` AT MOST 3 THEN 26
           IF `to grade` AT MOST 6 THEN 37
           OTHERWISE 38

#ASSERT map `months in the grade below for promotion to, as the 31.8.2016 agreement sets them` (LIST 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9) EQUALS LIST 26, 26, 37, 37, 37, 38, 38, 38

-- (ג): the new periods reach also those who would have been due a
-- promotion from 1.9.2016 on but for this agreement — the test is the day
-- of the promotion, as §ה of the decision of 19.2.2015 has it for its own.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c
GIVEN `promotion day` IS A DATE, `to grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months in the grade below for promotion to, from 1.9.2016` `promotion day` `to grade` IS
    IF `promotion day` `is on or after` `1 September 2016`
    THEN `months in the grade below for promotion to, as the 31.8.2016 agreement sets them` `to grade`
    ELSE `months in the grade below for promotion to on` `promotion day` `to grade`

-- The three periods side by side: before 1.3.2015 (§38), from 1.3.2015
-- (the decision) and from 1.9.2016 (this agreement).
#ASSERT `months in the grade below for promotion to, from 1.9.2016` (DATE_FROM_DMY 28 2 2015) 2 EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `months in the grade below for promotion to, from 1.9.2016` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2016) 2 EQUALS 25
#ASSERT `months in the grade below for promotion to, from 1.9.2016` `1 September 2016` 2 EQUALS 26
#ASSERT `months in the grade below for promotion to, from 1.9.2016` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2016) 7 EQUALS 37
#ASSERT `months in the grade below for promotion to, from 1.9.2016` `1 September 2016` 7 EQUALS 38

-- (ד): nothing in §4 detracts from the rest of the base agreement, as
-- amended, or from other collective arrangements on promotion, unless this
-- agreement expressly says otherwise: §38's other clauses, and the
-- longest a qualified teacher may be held back as the decision of
-- 19.2.2015 set it (§38(ט)), stand.
@ref akn:art_4__para_d
#ASSERT map `months a qualified teacher may be held back from, as the 2015 decision sets them` (LIST 7, 8, 9) EQUALS LIST 37, 49, 61

§§ `5 מיצוי תביעות ושקט תעשייתי`

-- akn:art_5 The heading of §5; its paragraph follows.
-- akn:art_5/p1 Neither detracts from nor adds to the exhaustion of claims and industrial peace that bind the parties: no rule of its own.

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The Treasury's file number; no rule.
